  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Feasible region is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi></math><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/29ad1c2a-a79d-4dee-9be2-09892ed13180-image.png\" style=\"width: 370px; height: 264px;\" /></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mn>15</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>65</mn></math></p><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>160</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi></math> is attained at point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, option <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>d</mi></mfenced></math> is correct.</p>",
